        "description": "I`ve created a few food items specifically for you. Here are the object categories:\n* Burger`s box\n* Canned food\n* Cereals\n* Chocolate\n* Coffee (various versions)\n* Cookies (Oreo and others)\n* Milk bottles\n* Instant noodles (cups and box/bag)\n* Pasta\n* Pizza box\n* Sauce bottles\n* Tea box\n\nEverything is designed in a **low poly** style to save resources and reflect aesthetic of old-fashioned PS1/PS2 games.",
